                                "sense_id": "71ea4d1e-db3e-35f4-b4a3-6703e135d54a",
                                "text": "‘I didn′t mind being groped by him,’ Crystal replied. ‘He was cute. In fact I′m looking forward to later; don′t I have to pretend to give him a blowie?’"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "80d0196d-6104-4fed-bdd8-2b0e0e29cf7a",
