                                "text": "2010, Zoe Foster, Playing the Field, Round 23: The Enchantress vs The Press, unnumbered page,\n‘A brothel. Anyway, they got kicked out ′cos one of them – not Josh – took photos on his mobile of some bird giving him a blowie, and she flipped out.’"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
