                                "sense_id": "016cc88c-2070-3173-9147-dc1ba2e68d6d",
                                "text": "I woke just in time to hear the first blowie of the day buzzing around. You know the night's over when you hear the first blowie."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b773cbaf-8f4e-47e3-a117-9be029a55e7b",
                                "sense_id": "016cc88c-2070-3173-9147-dc1ba2e68d6d",
                                "text": "The blowie was still hoverin around making random swoops on Boris who by now was well beyond caring."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "968902d9-6eb6-400b-8c09-571f49c1dcce",
                                "sense_id": "016cc88c-2070-3173-9147-dc1ba2e68d6d",
                                "text": "Mouths are clamped shut to keep out blowies, with a slit at the corner prised open in case speech - preferably laconic - is necessary; miseries are borne with a stoical shrug."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f0a02c58-bfbc-3099-85e2-5948b6b3844f",
                        "entry_id": "20c2b779-e89f-3ecf-9ee3-08cfd08f771d",
