                                "sense_id": "f0a02c58-bfbc-3099-85e2-5948b6b3844f",
                                "text": "There was always a mob fishing from the jetty, although nobody ever caught much — just trumpeters and gobblies and blowies, and sometimes the pretty little yellow-tail with their golden scales and blue spots."
